Secure Share database migrations
================================

Run migrations through the application so environment-backed database
configuration and SQLite foreign-key safeguards are loaded:

    flask --app run.py init-db

The retained ``init-db`` command upgrades a versioned database, initializes an
empty database, or safely adopts the exact schema that predates Alembic. Use
``flask --app run.py db current`` and ``flask --app run.py db history`` for
diagnostics. Never stamp an unknown schema manually.
